Modstoke Manager by OpenACAI (formerly OpenACAI Mod Manager)
Copyright (C) 2026 Alex Cooper

Modstoke Manager contains original changes by Alex Cooper, published by OpenACAI.
It is based on RedManager by Toni Macaroni, originally licensed under Apache-2.0.
It installs and manages Modstoke Loader packages that are built
on BepInEx's Unity IL2CPP loader and RedLoader/SonsSdk compatibility components.

Upstream projects credited by this manager:

- BepInEx, by the BepInEx team: https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx
- RedLoader/SonsSdk and RedManager, by Toni Macaroni:
  https://github.com/ToniMacaroni/RedLoader
  https://github.com/ToniMacaroni/RedManager

Modstoke Admin, the private anti-cheat and admin mod, is not part of this repository.

Sons of the Forest art:

The manager ships no Sons of the Forest assets. Its Sons of the Forest skin
reads its frame and backdrop textures, which remain the property of Endnight
Games, from the player's own game installation at runtime and caches them for
that user only. The skin's font is the game's copy of Google's Roboto
(Apache-2.0), read the same way.
